# .gitignore

## Build outputs
bin/
obj/
publish/
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb

## IDE
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.sln.docstates

## VS Code
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

## Rider
.idea/

## NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage/

## Database
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
netusagemonitor.db

## Logs
logs/
*.log

## Credentials (never commit)
*credential*
*secret*
*password*.json

## OS
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

## Publish
*.msi
*.zip
*.exe.config

## Temporary
*.tmp
*.temp
temp/
tmp/

## Benchmark
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

## Code coverage
*.cobertura.xml
*.opencover.xml